00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.380
Speaker 1: The Donald Trump rape trial has&nbsp;
started. A lot to discuss here as well. Started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:15.360
yesterday. NPR has a good primer. We might call it&nbsp;
Five Things to Know as Jean Carroll's civil trial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:21.960
begins against Donald Trump. Jury selection&nbsp;
begins Tuesday. This is the defamation suit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:28.260
brought against Trump by Jean Carroll. Late last&nbsp;
year, Carroll accused Trump of causing significant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:33.900
pain and suffering, lasting psychological harms,&nbsp;
loss of dignity and invasion of her privacy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:39.240
Trump's lawyers say the statute under which&nbsp;
the assault claim was brought against Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:45.360
violates due process. The core of this is that&nbsp;
Carroll claims Trump raped her in the changing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:52.920
room of the Bergdorf Goodman Department store&nbsp;
in Manhattan in the 1990s. The suit says as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:57.660
result of the pain and suffering caused by that&nbsp;
sexual assault, she has not been able to sustain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:02.893
a romantic relationship since that day. Trump's&nbsp;
lawyers are expected to argue Carroll's nearly 30&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.893 --> 00:01:09.120
year old claims cannot be proved and that she was&nbsp;
motivated by potential book sales and publicity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:16.740
Important to know, Carroll has sued Trump already&nbsp;
twice, and both matters are still active. There's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:24.600
the defamation suit from November of 2019 and&nbsp;
a November 22 suit filed under New York's Adult&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:30.660
Survivors Act, which opens a one year window&nbsp;
when people alleged sexual assault to bring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:37.500
civil claims older than those that would normally&nbsp;
be allowable. So that is happening. There are not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.700
cameras in the courtroom. There are not cameras&nbsp;
in the courtroom as far as I was able to research&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:47.100
this morning. A couple other notes. The trial in&nbsp;
Manhattan federal court is expected to last 5 to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:55.080
7 days, reports Business Insider. And Donald Trump&nbsp;
is not there in person, Trump said in October on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:04.380
Troth Central this Miss Bergdahl Dorf Goodman case&nbsp;
is a complete con job. It's a hoax and a lie. Like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:11.340
all the other hoaxes that have been played on me&nbsp;
for the last seven years. It is unclear whether&nbsp;&nbsp;

